! There are 3 Irregular verbs in ciNyanja (Miti): ndi (copula),
! and 2 "Deficient" verbs: -li & -ti
! What about "ndidzakhala ndikubwera" = "I will be (in the state of) coming"???
!kozala:zal Aux-Verb-Suffix ;
ndi:ndi Verb-Suffix ; ! The verb "To be" can also be expressed using the focus particle
li:li Verb-Suffix ; ! The deficient verb "To be" has no TAM
ti:ti Verb-Suffix ; ! The deficient verb "To say" has no TAM

